      { "@type": "Question", "name": "What's the difference between Banjara, Lambadi, Lambani, Gormati, and Sugali?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "These are regional names for the same broader nomadic community. Lambadi/Lambada/Sugali is common in Telangana and Andhra Pradesh, Lambani in Karnataka, Gormati mainly in Maharashtra, Vanjara in Gujarat, and Banjara is used widely across Rajasthan and North India. BanjaraMatch serves all of these together." } },
